  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Virunga Hydropower Project, through Kleinschmidt Associates</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A grant to Virunga Power Kenya Limited funds a feasibility study (&quot;Study&quot;) to support the development of three run-of-river hydroelectric plants that would supply 15.7 megawatts of additional generation capacity in rural Kenya. The Study will assess the technical and economic viability of the Project and provide the data and analysis necessary to secure financing for implementation. A U.S. contractor to complete the Study will be competitively selected through the Federal Business Opportunities website.</narrative>
  </description>
